reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/combat/notes.md:46:Only `docs/01-foundations/pharmacology/voiding-outlet/5-alpha-reductase-inhibitors.mdx` discusses CombAT (no other page contains the acronym; PARTEM and P-EASY lines in `prostate-artery-embolization.mdx` use dutasteride plus tamsulosin only as a comparator).
