reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/pae-vs-turp/notes.md:22:- The 5-year "42% of PAE patients had TURP" figure is not in the abstract. It is taken from the EAU guideline text (section 5.3.4.b) and recorded as a delivery Fact with that locator; the page attributes it to the EAU guideline. It equals 20/48 (41.7%), the figure the existing PAE page and the BPH index page use. Verify against the 5-year full text when available.
