reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/pae-vs-turp/notes.md:25:- The 2021 report is internally inconsistent on TURP-arm further surgery: Results give 5 patients (10%) with additional surgical procedures; the Discussion gives 7.8%. The file uses the Results figure (5 of 51).
