reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/optimal/notes.md:26:Not found: the operative time, blood loss and length-of-stay values (eTable 4 of the supplement); the page says only that they did not differ significantly. Supplement and per-arm adverse event tables of the journal version were not opened.
