reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/tomus/notes.md:5:The relevant methods, results, and discussion sections were read in publisher or PubMed Central full-text search renderings; the PubMed records were checked for author order, journal, year, volume, pages, DOI, and PMID. The direct article landing pages intermittently returned a browser challenge, so the online search rendering supplied the text. No owner PDF or source-local article text matching the primary DOI or TOMUS title was found. All four `source.file` values are therefore `null`.
