reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/stitch/notes.md:6:- JAMA Surg 2026 13-year report, doi 10.1001/jamasurg.2026.0618, PMID 41920572: abstract only (PubMed efetch XML, plus the JAMA page, which shows the abstract and is paywalled beyond it). Not opened: full text and its Results and Tables. `source.level` is `abstract`; `met` is null for its primary result.
