reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/sister/notes.md:13:The AUA/SUFU *Surgical Treatment of Female Stress Urinary Incontinence* guideline, 2017 and amended 2023, was read from `/Users/joyboy/Documents/WARWIKI/warwiki/reports/audit-v2/sources-local/aua-sui-2023-unabridged.txt`, statements 12 and 19 on printed pages 2–3 and the accompanying SISTEr discussion on printed pages 20–21. The local copy supplies the recommendation strengths printed on the appraisal page. No AUA website was opened.
