docs/04-surgical-techniques/04l-cosmetic-genital-surgery/hardrock-sandwich-technique.mdx:10:For the broader male cosmetic-genital-surgery decision framework see the [Male Cosmetic Genital Surgery atlas page](/docs/surgical-techniques/04l-cosmetic-genital-surgery/male-cosmetic). For the SLD-only deep-dive see [Suspensory Ligament Division](/docs/surgical-techniques/04l-cosmetic-genital-surgery/suspensory-ligament-division). For an FDA-cleared cosmetic penile implant see [Penuma & Himplant](/docs/surgical-techniques/04l-cosmetic-genital-surgery/penuma).<sup>[[10]](#ref10)[[21]](#ref21)</sup>
