173 
174 Pubovaginal sling using rectus fascia or fascia lata. Established evidence; a non-mesh surgical option when synthetic material is declined or unsuitable. AUA/SUFU 2023 advises against synthetic midurethral sling placement during concomitant urethral diverticulectomy, urethrovaginal fistula repair, or urethral mesh excision <Rec>(Clinical Principle)</Rec>, and advises strong consideration of mesh avoidance after radiation or with significant scarring or poor tissue quality <Rec>(Expert Opinion)</Rec>.<sup>[[10]](#ref10)</sup> Higher voiding dysfunction rate than midurethral slings; durable long-term results.<sup>[[8]](#ref8)</sup><sup>[[10]](#ref10)</sup>
