29:The AUA 2026 BPH guideline states that clinicians may offer the intraprostatic drug-coated balloon for prostates of 20–80 cc, a prostatic urethral length of 32–55 mm and no obstructing median lobe <Rec>(Conditional Recommendation; Evidence Level Grade C)</Rec>.<sup>[[21]](#ref21)</sup> The US label indicates the device for obstructive symptoms from BPH in men 50 years or older and contraindicates it in patients with hypersensitivity to paclitaxel or structurally related compounds, an active urinary tract infection, an artificial urinary sphincter or a penile prosthesis.<sup>[[23]](#ref23)</sup> Because paclitaxel was detectable in semen at 12 months in 1 of 3 evaluable men in the label's selected pharmacokinetic sample, the label advises abstinence or a condom for 30 days and highly effective contraception to avoid fathering a child for at least 12 months, with longer precautions by shared decision.<sup>[[21]](#ref21)[[23]](#ref23)</sup>
38:- PINNACLE excluded intravesical prostatic protrusion above 1 cm; 28/100 Optilume participants had some protrusion
42:The AUA 2026 Conditional Recommendation (Grade C) applies to prostates 20–80 cc with a prostatic urethral length of 32–55 mm and no obstructing median lobe; PINNACLE enrolled men with prostate volumes of 20–80 g, while the US label does not list median-lobe obstruction as a contraindication.<sup>[[21]](#ref21)[[5]](#ref5)[[23]](#ref23)</sup> PINNACLE compared the active arm at 12 months with the sham arm at 3 months; only the active arm continued follow-up beyond 1 year, while single-arm EVEREST-I follow-up reached 4 years.<sup>[[5]](#ref5)[[8]](#ref8)[[22]](#ref22)</sup>
50:- **Equipment and sizing:** the kit holds one uncoated 90 Fr x 30 mm predilation balloon and one coated balloon of the same diameter, 30, 35, 40 or 45 mm long, chosen by transrectal-ultrasound prostatic urethral length (32 to 37, 37 to 42, 42 to 47 or above 47 mm, measured from the bladder-neck base, not the tip of an intravesical protrusion). A rigid cystoscope with at least a 19.5 Fr sheath is used, and each balloon is used side by side with the scope.<sup>[[23]](#ref23)</sup>
