@@ -146,7 +146,7 @@
 | Qmax improvement (2 yr) | +3.9 mL/s | +10.2 mL/s |
 | PVR reduction (2 yr) | −62 mL | −204 mL<sup>[[17]](#ref17)</sup> |
 | Prostate volume reduction (2 yr) | −10.7 mL | −30.2 mL<sup>[[17]](#ref17)</sup> |
-| Retreatment at 2 yr | 21% (TURP within 2 yr)<sup>[[17]](#ref17)</sup> | Not reported |
+| Further surgery at 2 yr | 10/48 (21%) crossed over to TURP; 1/48 (2%) had another procedure<sup>[[17]](#ref17)</sup> | 5/51 (10%) had another procedure<sup>[[17]](#ref17)</sup> |
 | Total adverse events | Fewer (43 vs 78, p = 0.005) | More |
 | Ejaculatory preservation | Better | Worse |
 | Erectile function | Similar | Similar |

