16:| **Intact abdominal skin** | Use an alcohol-based antiseptic unless contraindicated (CDC 2017). WHO's own Recommendation 12 is a strong recommendation, low-to-moderate quality evidence, for an alcohol-based chlorhexidine gluconate solution; an iodophor–alcohol preparation is a trial-supported alternative from later trials, not from the WHO recommendation itself. Check the exact product, allergy history and procedure.<sup>[[1]](#ref1)[[2]](#ref2)[[3]](#ref3)[[11]](#ref11)</sup> |

