reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/nitti-oab/notes.md:46:- `docs/01-foundations/pharmacology/storage-oab/botulinum-toxin.mdx`: numbers (n = 557, -2.65 vs -0.87, 22.9% vs 6.5%) match the abstract; "FDA-approved 2013 based on the Nitti and Chapple trials" is consistent with the label's two OAB studies (the approval letter itself does not name the studies).
