I read all 66 "'`reports/2026-10-18/clinical-evidence/work/*/notes.md` files and compared the flagged existing-page statements with the available primary full texts or guidance. This report records page corrections, not a new clinical appraisal. `touched.json` lists only the 34 page files edited for this task. Two concurrently modified genitalia pages are outside this task and are excluded. No clinical-evidence data or `docs/06-clinical-evidence` files were edited.

Source excerpts below are deliberately short. PDF page numbers refer to the PDF image when the publication pagination was not readily available. Source keys and exact paths follow the table. Where full text was available only on a publisher/PMC site, that is stated.

