| CARE continence values | `docs/03-clinical-conditions/03c-pelvic-support/pelvic-organ-prolapse.mdx`, CARE paragraph | **No change: page correct.** The 58% vs 38% and 32% vs 21% figures belong to the separately cited Visco 2008 stress-test analysis, not CARE'"'s corrected composite endpoint. Visco Table 5. |
